UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is tailored for aspiring leaders in media business, offering a blend of management and communication skills essential for the sector. Choose this program to meet industry needs, covering all aspects of media production, from film and TV to online content. It stands out by integrating business acumen with ethical practice, preparing you to navigate the complexities of media power and legal obligations. </p> <p> You''ll gain versatile skills, including business fundamentals from UTS''s Faculty of Business, to thrive in the creative economy. Learn to make smart decisions, leverage online platforms, and adapt to industry shifts, all while fostering ethical business models. Your learning journey will include building a professional portfolio to showcase your capabilities. </p> <p> Enhance your employability by selecting a second stream, diversifying your expertise in the media and communication landscape. Graduates find opportunities in various creative sectors, taking on roles in business development, strategic planning, and consultancy, among others. </p> <p> The rapid rise of digital technologies globally has transformed how the media do business. Based in the fundamentals of business best-practice, including two subjects housed within UTS’s Faculty of Business, this course builds a range of transferable skills. It will equip students with the conceptual frameworks and practical skillsets to drive business success in competitive creative industries, deal with dynamic environments, and establish sustainable, ethical practices. They will learn how to execute astute decisions, harness the reach and influence of online distribution channels, and negotiate emerging challenges and opportunities within various workplace scenarios, including their own creative entrepreneurial work. Throughout the course students build a portfolio of work to promote themselves in the job market. </p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 156,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 137715,
