UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> The Bachelor of Engineering (Combined with the Bachelor of Sustainability and Environment) is a comprehensive double degree program that will equip you with a robust foundation in a specialised engineering discipline and a multidisciplinary understanding of sustainability, essential for navigating the green economy. </p> <p> You will build your knowledge of sustainability as a scientific, legal, and social domain. The course offers a unique blend of theoretical and practical experience, ensuring that you will be well prepared for the challenges of the modern engineering and sustainability sectors. Excursions and studios with industry and community partners in sustainability and environment core subjects will provide you with opportunities to consolidate knowledge, apply new skills to creative solutions, and learn through experience. </p> <p> This combined degree is ideal if you are passionate about engineering and sustainability, and want to make a significant impact on the world by creating sustainable solutions. As a graduate of this program you will be well equipped to take on leadership roles in the engineering and sustainability sectors, driving innovation and change for a better future. </p>',
