UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is tailored for individuals aiming to excel in the biotechnology sector or seeking to merge scientific expertise with business acumen. It bridges the gap between cutting-edge biotechnological science and strategic business management. </p> <p> You will acquire a robust understanding of biological processes and the competencies to innovate in pharmaceuticals, vaccines, and organic production. Simultaneously, you will develop business management skills pertinent to science-driven enterprises. </p> <p> Expect a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical application, facilitated through lectures, labs, and real-world case studies. This approach ensures you emerge well-prepared to navigate and lead in diverse professional environments, from biotech research to business strategy within the life sciences. </p> <p> Students study the biological processes of living organisms and learn the skills required to manipulate processes in the development of new pharmaceuticals, vaccines, food or organic substances. This combined degree allows students to choose between a career in business or biotechnological science. </p>',
