idge C1A/C2P: overall 176, writing 169</p> </td></tr><tr><td><strong>English Proficiency</strong></td><td><ul><li>IELTS (Academic) score: 6.5 overall with a writing score of 6.0 (or equivalent).</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>',
