UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is tailored for professionals seeking to enhance their expertise in human resource management (HRM) and employment relations. Opt for this programme to acquire a robust blend of theoretical knowledge and practical HRM skills, with the option to advance to a Master''s degree upon successful completion. </p> <p> Stand out with a distinctive curriculum that mirrors the Master''s programme, yet demands fewer study units. You''ll gain a comprehensive understanding of HRM challenges and management practices. </p> <p> Expect to develop proficiency in HRM and industrial relations, equipping you with the competencies to excel in your career. Learning is interactive, combining theory with real-world application, ensuring you''re workplace-ready. </p> <p> Find out more about <a href="https://www.uts.edu.au/study/business/business-courses/study-management/postgraduate-options-management/why-human-resource-management"> Why Human Resource Management </a> . </p> <p> Students gain a comprehensive understanding of HRM challenges and management practices. Expect to develop proficiency in HRM and industrial relations, equipping them with the competencies to excel in their career. Learning is interactive, combining theory with real-world application, ensuring they are workplace-ready. </p>',
