UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is designed for postgraduate students seeking to deepen their grasp of complex management challenges. Choose this course for a comprehensive exploration of management principles, building on the Graduate Certificate in Management. The course’s innovative structure allows you to tailor your studies to your specific goals and responsibilities in management. You will acquire advanced knowledge and practical skills in strategic decision-making, leadership, and problem-solving. Expect an interactive learning experience, with a mix of lectures, case studies, and group discussions. </p> <p> Find out more about <a href="https://www.uts.edu.au/study/business/business-courses/study-management/postgraduate-options-management/why-management"> Why Management </a> . </p> <p> The course’s innovative structure allows students to tailor their studies to their specific goals and responsibilities in management. They acquire advanced knowledge and practical skills in strategic decision-making, leadership, and problem-solving. Expect an interactive learning experience, with a mix of lectures, case studies, and group discussions. </p>',
