UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is tailored for professional scientists seeking skill enhancement for career progression and for those contemplating research degrees. Opt for this program to enhance your professional portfolio with a blend of core professional training and advanced medical biotechnology experience. </p> <p> What sets this course apart is its dual focus on sector-specific biotechnology expertise alongside versatile professional development. You''ll acquire competencies in communication, critical analysis, project management, and the ability to bring innovations to market, all of which are crucial in today''s science sectors. </p> <p> You will emerge with a robust skill set, including abilities to manage projects, innovate and commercialise scientific discoveries. </p> <p> Learning is highly interactive and practical, ensuring you can apply your new skills directly to your work in research, science businesses, industries, or government. Graduates are well-prepared for roles in private and public sectors, particularly in medical and health fields where they can advance scientific frontiers for the benefit of global communities. </p> <p> The course contains a compulsory core of professional subjects relevant to all science disciplines, such as project management, innovation, entrepreneurship and commercialisation. These core subjects provide a solid foundation to skills required and are important to a professional scientist; be they engaged in research, science businesses, industries or government organisations. </p>',
