UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is tailored for aspiring event management professionals seeking to advance their careers. Choose this course to gain a comprehensive understanding of the event industry and develop the skills needed for management roles. Its distinctiveness lies in the blend of academic excellence and real-world application, with input from industry experts ensuring relevance to current practices. You will learn to create, plan, market, and evaluate events in both Australian and international contexts. A focus on professional practice and career development planning will ensure your readiness for future career choices. </p> <p> The course culminates in either an Industry Research Project or an Internship Experience, providing hands-on engagement with contemporary industry issues. Teaching combines research-led content from leading academics with insights from industry partners, ensuring a balance of theoretical knowledge and practical skills. </p> <p> Find out more about <a href="https://www.uts.edu.au/study/business/business-courses/study-management/postgraduate-options-management/why-event-management"> Why Event Management </a> . </p> <p> Students learn to create, plan, market, and evaluate events in both Australian and international contexts. A focus on professional practice and career development planning ensure their readiness for future career choices. </p> <p> The course culminates in either an Industry Research Project or an Internship Experience, providing hands-on engagement with contemporary industry issues. Teaching combines research-led content from leading academics with insights from industry partners, ensuring a balance of theoretical knowledge and practical skills. </p>',
