    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> This course is intended for aspiring leaders in finance. It is distinguished by its flexibility, which allows you to tailor your degree to suit your interests. In addition to the six-subject core, which provides a solid foundation in finance, you may choose to complete a six-subject major plus four additional electives, or you may complete ten electives of your choice. The majors and electives allow you to develop specialised expertise in investment management, corporate finance, banking, financial technology, sustainable finance and ESG, and financial advice. </p> <p> The teaching approach is interactive, with an emphasis on real-world applications and critical thinking. The curriculum makes extensive use of case studies and other authentic learning experiences, which ensure that theoretical knowledge is enhanced through practical application. </p> <p> The course establishes a solid foundation in the principles of finance, which is enhanced by developing valuable analytical skills and the ability to apply their knowledge in real-world situations. Our interactive learning approach combines theory with practical application, ensuring that they are industry-ready upon completion. </p>',
