UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4> <p> Targeted at professionals seeking to master operations, logistics, procurement, and supply chain management, this course equips you with the skills to manage complex, global business networks. You''ll learn to navigate the evolving landscape of supply chains, service economies, digital technologies, and global competition. </p> <p> Distinguish yourself with our course''s unique blend of strategic and tactical insights. Specialise in network design and process improvement methodologies to enhance supply chain efficiency and product quality. Benefit from research-driven content and industry connections that provide practical experience. </p> <p> Gain knowledge in cutting-edge management practices, data analytics, and cloud computing. Our teaching methods focus on active learning through real-world projects and collaboration with industry leaders. </p> <p> Choose this course for a concise, impactful learning journey that positions you at the forefront of supply chain excellence, as evidenced by our top ranking in the QS Business Master’s Rankings 2025. </p> <p> Find out more about <a href="https://www.uts.edu.au/study/business/business-courses/study-management/postgraduate-options-management/why-strategic-supply-chain-management"> Why Supply Chain Management </a> . </p> <p> Stand out with our course''s unique blend of strategic and tactical insights. Specialise in network design and process improvement methodologies to enhance supply chain efficiency and product quality. Benefit from research-driven content and industry connections that provide practical experience. Gain knowledge in cutting-edge management practices, data analytics, and cloud computing. </p> <p> Our teaching methods focus on active learning through real-world projects and collaboration with industry leaders. Choose this course for a concise, impactful learning journey that positions students at the forefront of supply chain excellence, as evidenced by our top ranking in the QS Business Master’s Rankings 2023. </p>',
